{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"NoConvergence","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Power iterations (eigenvector and Katz centrality, PageRank, HITS), Lanczos and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conjugate-gradient runs, and QL eigenvalue iterations throw it. Each throwing method documents"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what it counts as an iteration and what its residual measures. The residual is on the scale of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the tolerance the method compares it with, which is the caller’s "},{"code":"tolerance","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" where the method"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes one, so "},{"code":"residual \/ tolerance","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" says how far from convergence the method stopped. It may"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be infinite or NaN when the iteration diverged."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["do throws(NoConvergence) {","    let scores = try graph.pageRank(maxIterations: 20)","    use(scores)","} catch {","    print(\"PageRank stopped after \\(error.iterations) iterations at \\(error.residual)\")","}"],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphProtocols\/NoConvergence.swift#L20","fileName":"NoConvergence.swift"},"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"NoConvergence","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"GraphProtocols"}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text